<title>USA: New York St. says Washington approves welfare plan.</title>
<headline>New York St. says Washington approves welfare plan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York State, which was criticized for filing its welfare plan late, on Friday said that Washington had approved its outline, paving the way for the state to start getting its $2.4 billion grant.</p>
<p>&quot;Now we're going through the process of trying to determine when the money will start flowing,&quot; said a spokesman for the state division of budget, explaining that the federal government will pay the new and bigger grant on a quarterly basis.</p>
</text>
